      "updated": 1779708211165,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "here we need to prover ourself twice\n\n1 username and password\n2 authenticator app\n\nauthenticator app we will get a 6 digit number that will change in every 30 sec, server will\nsay please send 6 digit code from your authenticator app.\nlets say we have send 724169, how server will verify this number\nat the time of setup lets say paypal account, at that time server will say you need to create\nauthenticator app and this 6 digit is generated by serverside and in our client side also\nwe will send that if it is matching we are authenticated otherwise not.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "here we need to prover ourself twice\n\n1 username and password\n2 authenticator app\n\nauthenticator app we will get a 6 digit number that will change in every 30 sec, server will\nsay please send 6 digit code from your authenticator app.\nlets say we have send 724169, how server will verify this number\nat the time of setup lets say paypal account, at that time server will say you need to create\nauthenticator app and this 6 digit is generated by serverside and in our client side also\nwe will send that if it is matching we are authenticated otherwise not.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
